B=r'''<style>.box p,.box li{font-size:20px;line-height:1.27}.box h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:5px}.tbl{font-size:18.5px}.note,.warn{font-size:17.5px}.tbl th,.tbl td{padding:3px 6px}.iq ol{font-size:19.5px;line-height:1.27}.pill{font-size:16px}.grid{gap:12px}.handle{bottom:-12px}.box{padding:11px 13px}.tagline{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:9px}.code{font-family:Consolas,'DejaVu Sans Mono',monospace;font-size:15px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px dashed #94a3b8;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 7px;margin:4px 0;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.3;white-space:normal;overflow:visible;font-size:16px}</style>
<div class="title">🏷️ HxGN EAM Barcoding <span class="badge">CHEAT SHEET</span></div>
<div class="tagline">Design, print and reprint barcode / QR labels for parts, stock, bins and equipment, straight from EAM transactions, EAM Mobile or batch runs. (HxGN EAM 12.3 Barcoding brief)</div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="box c1"><h2>1. What + install</h2><ul><li>Windows app to identify, label, collect, transfer and track parts</li><li>Setup: <b>Apache</b> (Tomcat) or <b>IIS</b> as Print Job Receiver, or <b>Custom</b> = Batch Printing only</li><li>Barcoding version must match EAM (v11.5 ↔ v11.5)</li><li>Add EAM app server as a trusted site</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c2"><h2>2. Users + licences</h2><ul><li><b>Administration › Security › Setup</b> › Record View › tick <b>HxGN EAM Barcoding</b></li><li>LDAP: same flag on <b>Role Setup</b></li><li>Active users capped by <b>CDKEY</b> (EAM) / <b>7IBCDKEY</b> (Mobile)</li><li>At least one Mobile Administrator runs the first data sync</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c3"><h2>3. App menus</h2><table class="tbl"><tr><th>Menu</th><th>Tabs / use</th></tr><tr><td><b>Print Jobs</b></td><td>Jobs, Job History</td></tr><tr><td><b>Templates</b></td><td>Templates, Page Layout, Label Designer</td></tr><tr><td><b>Batch Printing</b></td><td>Filter, sort, preview, print</td></tr><tr><td><b>Server Settings</b></td><td>Settings, Printers, Logs</td></tr></table></div>
<div class="box c4"><h2>4. Template data sources</h2><ul><li>Equipment, Location, Meter Equipment</li><li>Stores, Parts, Stock, Bins, Suppliers, Employee</li><li>Issue/Return Parts, On-Dock Receipt, Storeroom Receipt</li><li>Templates can be <b>Imported / Exported</b></li></ul></div>
<div class="box c5"><h2>5. Page Layout + Label Designer</h2><ul><li>Unit: English (inch) / Metric (cm)</li><li>Print Type: Single Sheet / Continuous</li><li>Custom format: margins, spacing, height/width, Across × Down</li><li>Per field: Display Barcode / Label / Value + Font Size</li><li>Drag in preview → Barcode Position X/Y</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c6"><h2>6. Symbologies</h2><ul><li>Code 128, Code 39, Code 39 Ext</li><li>UPC-A, UPC-E, <b>QR Code</b></li><li>Barcode Height, Text Font, Number of Duplicates</li></ul><div class="warn">A QR code still holds ONE string (e.g. only the Part Number). No extra data packed in.</div></div>
<div class="box c7"><h2>7. Label Server URL (Stores)</h2><p><b>IIS</b> (path must be UPPERCASE):</p><div class="code">http(s)://[server]:[port]/PRINTJOBRECEIVER/RECEIVER.ASPX</div><p><b>Apache/Tomcat:</b></p><div class="code">http(s)://[server]:[port]/PrintJobReceiver/ReceiverServlet</div><div class="note">Tomcat ships a self-signed cert: swap for a CA cert (server.xml › certificateKeystoreFile) and restart the service.</div></div>
<div class="box c8"><h2>8. Server Settings</h2><ul><li>User ID, Password, Organization, Connection ID, Server Address, Proxy</li><li>Retrieval Interval (s), Retries on Errors</li><li>Keep Job History / Server Log (days)</li><li><b>Test Connection</b>; must be set before printing</li><li>Logs tab: Purge All</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c1" style="grid-column:1 / span 2"><h2>9. Printing from EAM + Mobile</h2><table class="tbl"><tr><th>Where</th><th>Labels print on</th></tr><tr><td><b>EAM screens</b></td><td>Issue/Return Parts · Non-PO Receipts (Parts tab) · PO Receipts (Active Lines tab) · Store-to-Store Receipts (Parts tab) · Held Items Transfer · Held Items to Stock · Stock to Held Items</td></tr><tr><td><b>EAM Mobile</b></td><td>Issue Part, Return Part, PO Receive</td></tr><tr><td><b>Template fields</b></td><td>On Stores record + Parts › Stores tab: Receipt, Non-PO Receipt, Issue, Store-to-Store, Held Items (Receipt / on PO / on Non-PO / Transfer / to Stock), Stock to Held, Core Return (Parts › Stores tab only)</td></tr></table></div>
<div class="bottom">
<div class="box" style="border-color:#1a5f7a"><h2 style="color:#1a5f7a">10a. Print flow</h2><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">EAM / Mobile transaction</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Stores label template</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Label Server URL</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Print Job Receiver</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Printer</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Job History (reprint)</span></div></div>
<div class="box iq"><h2>10b. Consultant tips</h2><ol><li>Check URL case for IIS first</li><li>Test Connection before go-live</li><li>Reprint can change Template + Printer</li><li>Batch filters accept relative dates: &gt;="-7"</li></ol></div>
<div class="box" style="border-color:#2d8a5a"><h2 style="color:#2d8a5a">10c. Key points</h2><ul><li>Template = data source + layout</li><li>Stores holds the template</li><li>Versions must match</li></ul></div>
</div></div>'''
build("/workspace/instagram-assets/posts/2026-10-26-linkedin-eam-barcoding",B,1620,"Rahul Kumar")
